            "review_title": "Review at Cheongdam Korean BBQ & Sushi",
            "review_text": "Xpatxplorer\nNew Delhi, India811 contributions\n0\nWell Priced\nMay 2023 • Friends\nFirst time trying Korean BBQ Cheongdam BBQ Thaodien. The meal started with many small\nPlates a soup and a kind of baked egg that we hadn’t ordered. I was told they come in proportion to the mains you order. Either we ordered a lot or they were generous:) . I was given a heads up by the table Korean food expert not to have too much of these else the main would be difficult to get through. Thoroughly enjoyed the experience. They offered to grill and bring us the meat or to be grilled at the table. We chose the latter and I think that definitely added to the experience. While it wasn’t cheap I was told by the Korean BBQ expert that this place is relatively well priced compared to others in the vicinity. Thoroughly enjoyed the experience!\nRead more\nWritten May 13, 2023",
